  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Let embedded machines bind credentials the way the CLI's --credential does by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1608\n* Keep cache disks through machine run, pause and portable checkpoints by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1609\n* Keep smolvm's state on /workspace when the home is overlayfs, so a default install inside a smol machine can boot VMs by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1610\n* Record a symlink's archived owner for host-unpacked pack layers by @Bnjoroge1 in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1601\n* Bump version to 1.25.0 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1611\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.24.2...v1.25.0",
